<title>UK: TBI Plc acquires London properties.</title>
<headline>TBI Plc acquires London properties.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property investment and development company TBI Plc said on Monday it had acquired properties in the London area for 19.4 million pounds ($31.43 million).</p>
<p>TBI said four land purchases were made from Hampton Trust as part of the group's strategy to acquire buildings with quality rental income, and with scope for future retail and capital growth. ($1=.6173 Pound)</p>
